.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
A basic arithmetic calculator tool\&. 

This tool performs simple mathematical operations such as:
.IP "\(bu" 2
Addition
.IP "\(bu" 2
Subtraction
.IP "\(bu" 2
Multiplication
.IP "\(bu" 2
Division
.PP

.PP
It is intended for use by \fBAI\fP models that should not invent numerical results but instead rely on deterministic tool output\&. 
